  "name": "auto-build-cli-after-done-merge",
  "title": "Auto-build main CLI dist after DONE merges touch runtime sources",
  "description": "After a story merges back to local main, the global lattice executable can point at packages/main/dist/cli.js while packages/main/src has changed. This leaves main updated but the usable CLI stale. Make DONE merge rebuild the package when CLI runtime inputs changed, and make failure explicit.",
